OL,3,GNEWSAMultiple crews sent to tackle
OL,4,Awaste fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlmost 30 fire crews were called to a
OL,7,Fblaze that sent a huge plume of smoke
OL,8,Finto the sky above Barton in Fabis.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,11,Fsaid it was called to a fire in the
OL,12,Fopen in Barton Lane at 15:13 BST on
OL,13,FWednesday.
OL,15,FIn an update on Thursday, the fire
OL,16,Fservice confirmed the blaze was a "pile
OL,17,Fof rubbish that was well alight, and
OL,18,Fhad started to spread".
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
