OL,3,GNEWSAMultiple crews sent to tackle
OL,4,Awaste fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA total of 27 crews, including
OL,7,Fassistance from Derbyshire Fire and
OL,8,FRescue Service and specialist rescue
OL,9,Fvehicles, have visited the scene of the
OL,10,Ffire. Firefighters from three stations
OL,11,Fremain.
